menu "sys_actions"

    config SYS_ACTIONS_PARTITION
        string "NVS partition"
        default "project"
        help
          NVS data partition (partitions.csv) whose "actions" namespace holds
          the stored records, one blob (the image) per record, key "a<id>" with
          the 32-bit ID as 8 hex digits.

    config SYS_ACTIONS_MAX_BYTES
        int "Largest record (bytes)"
        default 4096
        range 256 16384
        help
          Largest image (frames with their u16 length). Also the static buffer
          a recording or upload is built in.

    config SYS_ACTIONS_MAX_BYTES_DEVICE
        int "Largest device record (bytes)"
        default 512
        range 64 16384
        help
          Largest image of a device-class record (ID 0x02......): the install
          and default commands of one device. Every other class uses
          SYS_ACTIONS_MAX_BYTES. Not above that one, which sizes the buffer.

    config SYS_ACTIONS_MAX_DEPTH
        int "Nested runs"
        default 3
        range 1 8
        help
          How deep a RUN inside an action may nest. Each level holds its image
          and a router frame of heap, and a few hundred bytes of the router
          task's stack.

endmenu
